{"meta":{"title":"فرض الفصل الأول في الإعلام الآلي","duration":"ساعة","term":1,"topics":["وحدات قياس الذاكرة: البايت ومضاعفاته","التحويل بين الوحدات","الملفات والمجلدات","امتدادات الملفات"]},"paper":"\n<div class=\"ex\">\n<h2>التمرين الأول <span class=\"pts\">(06 نقاط)</span></h2>\n<p>أكمل:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> بايت (Octet) <span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span></span></span></span> ...... بت.</li>\n<li><span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> كيلوبايت (Ko) <span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span></span></span></span> ...... بايت.</li>\n<li><span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> ميغابايت (Mo) <span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span></span></span></span> ...... كيلوبايت.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>رتّب من الأصغر إلى الأكبر: <b>Go – Ko – To – Mo</b>.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"ex\">\n<h2>التمرين الثاني <span class=\"pts\">(06 نقاط)</span></h2>\n<p>صِل كل ملف بنوعه:</p>\n<table class=\"grid\">\n<tbody><tr><td>درس.docx</td><td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"width:20%\"></td><td>صورة</td></tr>\n<tr><td>رحلة.jpg</td><td>نص</td></tr>\n<tr><td>نشيد.mp3</td><td>صوت</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>ما الفرق بين الملف والمجلد؟</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"ex\">\n<h2>التمرين الثالث <span class=\"pts\">(08 نقاط)</span></h2>\n<p>لدى سارة مفتاح USB سعته <span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Go</span></span></span></span></span></span> ، وتريد أن تنقل إليه <span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span> صورة حجم كل واحدة <span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mo</span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>احسب الحجم الكلي للصور بالميغابايت ثم بالغيغابايت (نأخذ <span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Go</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1024</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mo</span></span></span></span></span></span>).</li>\n<li>هل يكفي المفتاح لنقل كل الصور؟ علّل.</li>\n<li>اقترح على سارة طريقة لتنظيم صورها داخل المفتاح.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n","solution":"\n<div class=\"ex\"><h2>التمرين الأول</h2><table class=\"bareme\"><thead><tr><th>عناصر الإجابة</th><th>العلامة مجزأة</th><th>المجموع</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p data-pts=\"3×1\">1) <span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> ؛ 2) <span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1024</span></span></span></span></span> ؛ 3) <span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1024</span></span></span></span></span>.</p></td><td class=\"p\">3×1</td><td class=\"t\" rowspan=\"2\">6</td></tr><tr><td><p data-pts=\"3\">Ko ← Mo ← Go ← To.</p></td><td class=\"p\">3</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"ex\"><h2>التمرين الثاني</h2><table class=\"bareme\"><thead><tr><th>عناصر الإجابة</th><th>العلامة مجزأة</th><th>المجموع</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p data-pts=\"3×1\">درس.docx ← نص ؛ رحلة.jpg ← صورة ؛ نشيد.mp3 ← صوت.</p></td><td class=\"p\">3×1</td><td class=\"t\" rowspan=\"2\">6</td></tr><tr><td><p data-pts=\"3\">الملف يحتوي معلومات (نص، صورة، صوت…)، أما المجلد فهو حاوية لتنظيم الملفات ويمكن أن يحتوي ملفات ومجلدات أخرى.</p></td><td class=\"p\">3</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"ex\"><h2>التمرين الثالث</h2><table class=\"bareme\"><thead><tr><th>عناصر الإجابة</th><th>العلامة مجزأة</th><th>المجموع</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p data-pts=\"2\">1) <span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1500</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mo</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td class=\"p\">2</td><td class=\"t\" rowspan=\"4\">8</td></tr><tr><td><p data-pts=\"2\"><span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1500</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">÷</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1024</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">46</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Go</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td class=\"p\">2</td></tr><tr><td><p data-pts=\"2\">2) نعم يكفي، لأن <span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">46</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Go</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Go</span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p></td><td class=\"p\">2</td></tr><tr><td><p data-pts=\"2\">3) إنشاء مجلدات حسب المناسبة أو التاريخ (مثلًا: «رحلة 2026»، «العائلة») ووضع كل صور في مجلدها.</p></td><td class=\"p\">2</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n"}